diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 9806b52..82fa606 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -9,6 +9,8 @@ ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
 
+- Entities and memberships: `entities` (soft deletes, unique `slug`) and `entity_memberships` (roles `owner`, `admin`, `employee`). A stored generated `owner_seq` column with a unique index makes a second owner per entity impossible on SQLite and MariaDB. Policies `EntityPolicy` and `EntityMembershipPolicy`.
+- Entity pages under `/e/{entity:slug}`: `POST /e/{entity}/pick` stores the current entity in the session (audit-logged); the dashboard, `/membros` (add by e-mail, assign admin/employee, remove) and owner-only `/settings` (rename, change slug, soft-delete, transfer ownership to an admin) are Livewire components authorized through the policies.
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
